  "$comment": [
    "Witness for rule J7's first clause: a unit that is in the tree and not in the manifest.",
    "The plain field `position` is missing. It is exempt, so it carries no annotation, no",
    "fingerprint in any source file and no review state - which means that with no manifest entry",
    "either, nothing in the component records its existence at all, and changing its type from",
    "ulong to uint would move nothing any rule could see. That is the defeat this rule closes."
